{"id":"d1d3b024cc821344","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-first-order-clause.md","title":"无等号一阶子句与同时实例","display":"df-first-order-clause — 无等号一阶子句与同时实例","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-first-order-clause","aliases":["72-df-first-order-clause"],"display":"df-first-order-clause — 无等号一阶子句与同时实例","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; explicit local clause syntax","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-first-order-clause"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-first-order-clause</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-clause — 无等号一阶子句与同时实例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; explicit local clause syntax"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a> 的同一签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C_0,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C_0,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\">\\(C_0\\)</span> 表示常元符号集，与下方的子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 区分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 采用该语法，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}\">\\(\\operatorname{vars}\\)</span> 及同时代入采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a>；不含等式原子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是正原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 是文字，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是有限文字集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A\">\\(\\overline A\\)</span> 是带负标签的文字。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma:|C|&lt;\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma:|C|&lt;\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\overline A}:=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{atm}(A):=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{atm}(\\overline A):=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline{\\overline A}:=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{atm}(A):=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{atm}(\\overline A):=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C):=\\bigcup_{l\\in C}\\operatorname{vars}(l),\\qquad\nC\\theta:=\\{l\\theta:l\\in C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C):=\\bigcup_{l\\in C}\\operatorname{vars}(l),\\qquad\nC\\theta:=\\{l\\theta:l\\in C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是集合子句，因此同一代入可以把几个不同文字合成一个文字，空子句允许。代入对每个无绑定文字同时作用，不是对某个任选析取字符串逐次替换。语法复用IX章的已内建签名，但本簇使用经典二值语义，不继承四值否定的解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-logic-program-syntax]] 的同一签名 $\\Sigma=\\langle C_0,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R$、$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 及 $T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$；这里 $C_0$ 表示常元符号集，与下方的子句 $C$ 区分。$\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma$ 采用该语法，$\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{vars}$ 及同时代入采用 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]；不含等式原子。$A$ 是正原子，$l$ 是文字，$C$ 是有限文字集，$\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$。$\\overline A$ 是带负标签的文字。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-logic-program-syntax]] 的同一签名 $\\Sigma=\\langle C_0,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R$、$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 及 $T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$；这里 $C_0$ 表示常元符号集，与下方的子句 $C$ 区分。$\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma$ 采用该语法，$\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{vars}$ 及同时代入采用 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]；不含等式原子。$A$ 是正原子，$l$ 是文字，$C$ 是有限文字集，$\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$。$\\overline A$ 是带负标签的文字。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C_0,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"C_0","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"l","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma:|C|<\\omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\overline{\\overline A}:=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{atm}(A):=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{atm}(\\overline A):=A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C):=\\bigcup_{l\\in C}\\operatorname{vars}(l),\\qquad\nC\\theta:=\\{l\\theta:l\\in C\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1981,"backlinks":[{"id":"866d47bca0b3782c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-first-order-clause]] 沿用的同一签名 $\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R$、项集 $T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ 及正原子集；$\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{MGU}$ 使用 [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] 的该签名实例。"},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"4450994380fbceab","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [